{"ID":"20260916183232-5rzkfsi","Spec":"3","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260916183232-5rzkfsi","tags":"乱写诗词,祝福语","title":"元子眼见疏","type":"doc","updated":"20260916183232"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260916183232-qpxstkl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260916183232-qpxstkl","updated":"20260916183232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雨切切，风细细，山月盈盈目盈盈。"},{"Type":"NodeHardBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甜方糖，酸小枣，炊烟袅袅伊亭亭。"},{"Type":"NodeHardBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九天高，彼岸遥，秋人望穿瘦秋水。"},{"Type":"NodeHardBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鹊儿桥，老牛皮，星汉无情情有情。"}]}]}